Package: trigger5-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms (>= 2.1.0.0), ${misc:Depends}
Description: DKMS source for the MCT Trigger 5 USB display driver
 Kernel DRM/KMS driver for Magic Control Technology Trigger 5 USB 3.0
 display adapters (USB ID 0711:58xx), including the MCT USB3.0 External
 Graphics Device (0711:5805).
 .
 The driver implements modesetting, EDID retrieval over the adapter's
 DDC tunnel, and USB bulk frame transfers. This package carries the DKMS
 source, so the module is built against the installed kernel headers at
 install time and rebuilt automatically on kernel upgrades.
 .
 Note: this is unrelated to evdi; it is a standalone DRM driver.
